# Gtk3::SourceEditor

An embeddable **Vim-like** text editor widget.

## Features

- Syntax highlighting via GtkSourceView
- Vim modal keybindings
- Theme support

## Usage

```perl
use Gtk3::SourceEditor;
my $editor = Gtk3::SourceEditor->new(
    file => 'my_script.pl',
);
```
END_CODE

